  "description": "Dillon Marshall Property Consultants are delighted to introduce Lord Mayors to the rental market.\n\nLocated in the heart of Swords, Lord Mayors is a newly developed, A-rated residential development offering a superb selection of spacious one, two and three-bedroom apartments for rent. Finished to an exceptional standard throughout, these modern, energy-efficient homes combine contemporary design with comfort, quality and convenience.\n\nThe apartments have been thoughtfully designed with generous proportions and bright and stylish interiors. High-quality finishes and a strong focus on modern living create homes that are both comfortable and practical.\n\nThe development itself provides a peaceful and attractive residential setting while remaining within easy reach of a wide range of amenities. Residents can enjoy excellent access to shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, leisure facilities and transport links, making Lord Mayors an ideal location for convenient everyday living. \n\nOn site amenities include a gym, co-working space with private phone booths, on site concierge and parcel room. Parking is also available\n\nLord Mayors represents an excellent opportunity to secure a high-quality, modern home in one of North Dublin’s most sought-after and well-connected locations.",
